flowchart TB
  subgraph A[Authority plane - CPAG style integration]
    HM[Human policy owners] --> M[Versioned mandates]
    M --> E[Authorization evaluator]
    REV[Revocation and scope restrictions] --> E
  end
  subgraph B[TODM oracle control plane]
    BP[Human-reviewed baseline G2 - simulated here] --> BASE[Digest-checked SBVR DMN BPMN CMMN OCL profiles]
    BASE --> Q[G3 oracle qualification]
    Q --> O[Independent oracle evaluator G5]
  end
  subgraph C[Construction plane]
    AG[Agent or human constructor] --> CODE[.NET candidate G4]
    CODE --> EV[Observed behavior and trace]
  end
  EV --> O
  E --> R{G6: mandate PASS and oracle PASS and release approval?}
  O --> R
  R -->|No| BLOCK[Block and record reason]
  R -->|Yes - demo only| OK[Simulated allow, no deployment]
  BLOCK -.->|implementation defect| AG
  BLOCK -.->|ambiguous or incomplete evidence| BP
  OK -.-> MON[G7 observation - not connected]
